## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Top Bar
## Author: Devin
## Version: 2.3.0
## Notes: RTS-style resource strip across the top of the screen: gold, bag supply, durability, XP rate, and performance. With Commander Orders, your coordinates are its coordinate surface (click a waypoint, Shift-click share, Ctrl-click copy the /way line, right-click a menu), durability, bags and ammo go to the nearest repair, vendor and ammo vendor, and an optional readout shows the distance and arrival time to the waypoint the arrow is following.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\Ability_Warrior_RallyingCry
## SavedVariables: CommanderTopBarDB
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events
## OptionalDeps: Commander_Console, Commander_Orders

